// ModernJK's texts of the menus, beside the game's (strings/<Language>/MENUS.str): the reverb's setting (s_reverb) the mute without the focus (s_muteWhenUnfocused) and the sound device (s_device).
VERSION             "1"
CONFIG              "W:\bin\stringed.cfg"
FILENOTES           ""

REFERENCE           REVERB
LANG_ENGLISH        "Reverb:"
LANG_GERMAN         "Hall:"

REFERENCE           REVERB_DESC
LANG_ENGLISH        "Toggle the reverb of the rooms and places."
LANG_GERMAN         "Aktiviert und deaktiviert den Hall der Räume und Orte."

REFERENCE           MUTE_UNFOCUSED
LANG_ENGLISH        "Mute when unfocused:"
LANG_GERMAN         "Stumm ohne Fokus:"

REFERENCE           MUTE_UNFOCUSED_DESC
LANG_ENGLISH        "Mute the sound while the game's window is not in front."
LANG_GERMAN         "Schaltet den Ton stumm, solange das Spielfenster nicht im Vordergrund ist."

REFERENCE           SOUND_DEVICE
LANG_ENGLISH        "Sound device:"
LANG_GERMAN         "Audiogerät:"

REFERENCE           SOUND_DEVICE_DESC
LANG_ENGLISH        "The output the sound plays on: the system's default, or one of its outputs."
LANG_GERMAN         "Der Ausgang, auf dem der Ton spielt: der Standard des Systems oder einer seiner Ausgänge."

REFERENCE           SOUND_DEVICE_DEFAULT
LANG_ENGLISH        "Default"
LANG_GERMAN         "Standard"


ENDMARKER
